@page "/not-offline"
@inject NavigationManager Navigation
@* What every client path shows until a view declares it (PR 3.11 on): the path is not saved offline, and a full
   navigation to the Server page of the same path. The route itself is the router's NotFoundPage, never a gym route,
   so ClientRoutes.Declared does not list it. *@
<section class="bw-client-empty">
    <h1>Not available offline</h1>
    <p>This page is not saved on this device.</p>
    <a class="bw-client-online" href="@ClientRoutes.ServerPath(Navigation.ToBaseRelativePath(Navigation.Uri))">Open it online</a>
</section>
